        "sections": [
          {
            "heading": "Prioritize by sequencing against strategy and capacity",
            "content": "Treat prioritization and roadmapping as part of growth strategy: sequence the work so it makes sense for your growth models, and ensure you have the money or people to carry it out. Build a series of hypotheses and solutions to test, learn from the results, and productize those learnings. When communicating the roadmap, explain how experiments and other work fit into the larger bet.",
            "citation_ids": [
              "S1",
              "S5"
            ]
